/**
 * Product profiles.
 *
 * Two lenders that describe their qualitative requirements with the same
 * words are interchangeable for the qualitative stage.  A *profile* is that
 * group: the narrative rules plus the employment statuses the lender accepts.
 *
 * The profile signature is the first half of the LLM cache key.  The second
 * half is the bucket of the applicant facts the narrative actually refers to.
 */

